<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of four-week T-bills on Wednesday, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last auction of similar T-bills on October 9, the average yield hit 8.981 percent, up from 8.774 percent on October 2.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
